### Teste da Nova Estrutura de Metadados Estruturada para Comandos Firebird
### Este arquivo demonstra como usar a nova estrutura de metadados com databaseId
### NOTA: Estes comandos são enviados do servidor cloud para o nó desktop via gRPC streaming

### 1. Teste de Consulta Simples com DatabaseId
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_QUERY",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\", \"sql\": \"SELECT COUNT(*) as TOTAL_USUARIOS FROM USUARIOS\"}"
}

### 2. Teste de Inserção com DatabaseId Específico
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_EXECUTE_SQL",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-002\", \"sql\": \"INSERT INTO USUARIOS (NOME, EMAIL, ATIVO) VALUES ('João Silva', 'joao@email.com', 1)\", \"type\": \"INSERT\"}"
}

### 3. Teste de Listagem de Tabelas com DatabaseId
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_LIST_TABLES",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\"}"
}

### 4. Teste de Listagem de Colunas com DatabaseId e TableName
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_LIST_COLUMNS",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\", \"tableName\": \"USUARIOS\"}"
}

### 5. Teste de Informações da Base de Dados
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_DATABASE_INFO",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\"}"
}

### 6. Teste de Conexão com DatabaseId
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_TEST_CONNECTION",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\"}"
}

### 7. Teste de Comando com Timeout Personalizado
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_EXECUTE_SQL",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\", \"sql\": \"SELECT * FROM USUARIOS WHERE ATIVO = 1\", \"type\": \"SELECT\", \"timeout\": 60, \"validate\": true}"
}

### 8. Teste de Comando com Validação Desabilitada
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_EXECUTE_SQL",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\", \"sql\": \"SELECT * FROM USUARIOS\", \"type\": \"SELECT\", \"validate\": false}"
}

### 9. Teste de Comando sem DatabaseId (usa padrão)
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_QUERY",
  "metadata": "{\"sql\": \"SELECT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP as AGORA FROM RDB$DATABASE\"}"
}

### 10. Teste de Comando com Parâmetros Adicionais
POST http://localhost:7001/api/firebird/connection/{connectionId}/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "FIREBIRD_EXECUTE_SQL",
  "metadata": "{\"databaseId\": \"db-001\", \"sql\": \"SELECT * FROM USUARIOS WHERE ID > ?\", \"type\": \"SELECT\", \"timeout\": 30, \"validate\": true, \"additionalParameters\": {\"minId\": 100, \"maxResults\": 50}}"
}

